        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 26
      },
      {
        "text": "And Baasha the son of Ahijah, of the house of Issachar, conspired against him; and Baasha smote him at Gibbethon, which belonged to the Philistines; for Nadab and all Israel laid siege to Gibbethon.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 120,
            "end": 128
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 27,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Kings 15:27",
        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "Even in the third year of Asa king of Judah did Baasha slay him, and reigned in his stead.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 28,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Kings 15:28",
        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 28
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass, when he reigned, that he smote all the house of Jeroboam; he left not to Jeroboam any that breathed, until he had destroyed him, according unto the saying of the Lord, which he spake by his servant Ahijah the Shilonite:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 69,
            "end": 77,
            "text": "1 Kgs. 14:10 (1–18)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 38,
            "end": 42
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 29,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Kings 15:29",
        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 29
      },
      {
        "text": "Because of the sins of Jeroboam which he sinned, and which he made Israel sin, by his provocation wherewith he provoked the Lord God of Israel to anger.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 146,
            "end": 151,
